# The seven milled are Lightning Bolt (an instant), Sol Ring (an artifact), Ornithopter, Forest, Mountain, Island and
# Swamp. The instant and the artifact are not offered (refusals), Ornithopter is the creature card taken (the positive
# control: the same question accepts it). Exactly one card enters; the rest stay in the graveyard (CR 701.17). Resolving
# as an Adventure the card is exiled, not put into the graveyard (CR 715.4).

